tamp: 'jm 3/3/2009 17:01'!trueBlock	^ trueBlock! !!BlockMorph methodsFor: 'block enumerating' stamp: 'jm 3/3/2009 17:01'!pathFromTop	"Answer a 'path' from the top Block of this stack to the receiver. The path is a sequence of  indices into the blockSequence at each level of nesting. For control structure blocks (CBlock, IfElseBlock), the index is a Float that encodes the branch as follows:	1.0 - CBlock or IFElseBlock, following block	1.1 - CBlock, nested	1.2 - IFElseBlock, true	1.3 - IfElseBlock, false"	| path b i firstOfSubsequence |	path _ OrderedCollection new.	b _ self.	[b owner isKindOf: BlockMorph] whileTrue: [		firstOfSubsequence _ b firstBlockInSubstack.		i _ firstOfSubsequence blockSequence indexOf: b ifAbsent: [0].		path addFirst: i.		b _ firstOfSubsequence.		(b owner isKindOf: CBlockMorph) ifTrue: [			b owner nextBlock = b				ifTrue: [path addFirst: 1.0]				ifFalse: [path addFirst: 1.1].			b _ b owner].		(b owner isKindOf: IfElseBlockMorph) ifTrue: [			b owner nextBlock = b				ifTrue: [path addFirst: 1.0]				ifFalse: [					b owner trueBlock = b						ifTrue: [path addFirst: 1.2]						ifFalse: [path addFirst: 1.3]]]].	^ path asArray! !----SNAPSHOT----(3 March 2009 5:04:54 pm) priorSource: 7105118!!BlockMorph methodsFor: 'block enumerating' stamp: 'jm 3/3/2009 17:08' prior: 40674611!pathFromTop	"Answer a 'path' from the top Block of this stack to the receiver. The path is a sequence of  indices into the blockSequence at each level of nesting. For control structure blocks (CBlock, IfElseBlock), the index is a Float that encodes the branch as follows:	1.0 - CBlock or IFElseBlock, following block	1.1 - CBlock, nested	1.2 - IFElseBlock, true	1.3 - IfElseBlock, false"	| path b i subsequenceTop |	path _ OrderedCollection new.	b _ self.	[b owner isKindOf: BlockMorph] whileTrue: [		subsequenceTop _ b firstBlockInSubstack.		i _ subsequenceTop blockSequence indexOf: b ifAbsent: [0].		path addFirst: i.		b _ subsequ